M0609 컨트롤러&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;192.168.1.100 · TCP 12345&lt;br&gt;Dart Platform 2.12.1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#EFEFEF;strokeColor=#666666;rounded=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1190" y="620" width="240" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="arm" value="&lt;b&gt;M0609 협동로봇&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;6축 · 6 kg · 관절 토크 센서" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#EFEFEF;strokeColor=#666666;rounded=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1470" y="620" width="230" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rg2" value="&lt;b&gt;OnRobot RG2 그리퍼&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;폭 피드백 0~110 mm&lt;br&gt;설정 웹 192.168.1.1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#EFEFEF;strokeColor=#666666;rounded=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1470" y="740" width="230" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="common" value="&lt;b&gt;cobot_common  (라이브러리 — 노드 아님 · 박진용)      +      cobot_api  (기능 함수 약속: ID · 코드 · Result · 함수 서명 — PM)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;bootstrap.py: init(name) → DSR 전용 노드(flow_node_dsr) + 통신 노드(백그라운드 실행기) · shutdown()   🚨 두산 함수는 메인 스레드에서만 (TS-01 · SDD §3.2)&lt;br&gt;robot.py: move_to · move_rel · grip · grip_level · release · weigh · force_on/off · force_reached · contact_down · periodic_search · safe_retreat&lt;br&gt;config.py → config/cell.yaml (공용 좌표·속도·프리셋 · 한석형) + config/params.yaml (f1 · f2 · f3 · flow · hmi 절 — 자기 절만 수정)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#F7F7F7;strokeColor=#777777;dashed=1;rounded=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="502" width="980" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="csv" value="&lt;b&gt;records.csv&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;용기당 1행 (PC-A 로컬)" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#EFEFEF;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="130" y="128" width="180" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="web" value="&lt;b&gt;웹 서버 · 브라우저 · DB&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;(비워 둠)&lt;br&gt;황인재가 설계한 뒤&lt;br&gt;회의에서 함께 채운다" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8E7CC3;dashed=1;rounded=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1465" y="280" width="240" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t_state" value="&lt;b&gt;/flow/state&lt;/b&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#BF9000;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1140" y="105" width="250" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t_event" value="&lt;b&gt;/flow/event&lt;/b&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#BF9000;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1140" y="195" width="250" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t_joint" value="&lt;b&gt;/dsr01/joint_states&lt;/b&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#BF9000;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="700" width="230" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;범례&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;□ 사각형 = 노드&lt;br&gt;◯ 타원 = 토픽&lt;br&gt;→ 실선 화살표 = 서비스 호출(요청 방향)&lt;br&gt;     라벨 = 서비스 이름 : 타입&lt;br&gt;⇢ 점선 화살표 = 토픽 publish / subscribe&lt;br&gt;     라벨 = 메시지 타입&lt;br&gt;┄ 점선 상자 = 파이썬 패키지·함수(노드 아님)&lt;br&gt;→ 회색 가는 화살표 = 파이썬 함수 호출&lt;br&gt;━ 굵은 선 = 네트워크·물리 연결&lt;br&gt;색: 파랑 F1 · 초록 F2 · 주황 F3 · 보라 F4 · 회색 외부" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#F7F7F7;strokeColor=#777777;dashed=1;rounded=1;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1140" y="300" width="280" height="232" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e0" value="파이썬 함수 호출 (같은 프로세스 · 메인 스레드)&lt;br&gt;pick(zone_id, kind) → PickResult&lt;br&gt;place(station) → PlaceResult&lt;br&gt;move_to(station, carrying) → Result&lt;br&gt;tool(tool, action) → ToolResult&lt;br&gt;rack_place(rack_slot, kind) → Result" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=open;strokeColor=#888888;" edge="1" parent="1" source="flow" target="f1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="480" y="222"/><mxPoint x="210" y="222"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="파이썬 함수 호출&lt;br&gt;weigh(kind) → WeighResult&lt;br&gt;leftover_loop(kind, max_rounds) → LeftoverResult&lt;br&gt;shake(mode, count, kind) → Result&lt;br&gt;dip(station, count, kind) → Result" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=open;strokeColor=#888888;" edge="1" parent="1" source="flow" target="f2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="파이썬 함수 호출&lt;br&gt;soap(count) → Result&lt;br&gt;wipe_bowl() → WipeBowlResult&lt;br&gt;wipe_cup() → WipeCupResult&lt;br&gt;(반환 타입은 cobot_api)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=open;strokeColor=#888888;" edge="1" parent="1" source="flow" target="f3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="640" y="222"/><mxPoint x="910" y="222"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=open;strokeColor=#888888;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f1" target="common"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e4" value="파이썬 함수 호출 (import)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=open;strokeColor=#888888;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f2" target="common"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e5" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=open;strokeColor=#888888;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f3" target="common"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e6" value="서비스 호출 (DSR_ROBOT2 API 내부)  flow_node_dsr → dsr_controller2&lt;br&gt;/dsr01/dsr_controller2/motion/move_joint · move_line&lt;br&gt;/dsr01/dsr_controller2/force/task_compliance_ctrl&lt;br&gt;· set_desired_force · get_workpiece_weight  (dsr_msgs2/srv/…)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="common" target="dsr"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e7" value="/onrobot/sendCommand (srv)&lt;br&gt;OnRobotRGInput (topic · 현재 폭)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="common" target="grip"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e8" value="Modbus TCP · RG2 Compute Box 192.168.1.1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#1155AA;" edge="1" parent="1" source="grip" target="rg2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1440" y="835"/><mxPoint x="1440" y="805"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e9" value="CSV 기록" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=open;strokeColor=#888888;" edge="1" parent="1" source="flow" target="csv"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e10" value="publish · cobot_msgs/msg/FlowState · 2 Hz" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="flow" target="t_state"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e11" value="publish · cobot_msgs/msg/FlowEvent · 용기당 1건" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="flow" target="t_event"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1112" y="178"/><mxPoint x="1112" y="225"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e12" value="subscribe" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="t_state" target="hmi"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1428" y="135"/><mxPoint x="1428" y="180"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e13" value="subscribe" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="t_event" target="hmi"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e14" value="서비스 호출  hmi_bridge → flow_node      /flow/start · /flow/stop · /flow/resume : std_srvs/srv/Trigger" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="hmi" target="flow"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1690" y="70"/><mxPoint x="560" y="70"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e15" value="publish · sensor_msgs/msg/JointState" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="dsr" target="t_joint"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e16" value="subscribe" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="t_joint" target="rviz"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e17" value="두산 전용 TCP 12345 (DDS 아님) · 유선 192.168.1.x" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#1155AA;" edge="1" parent="1" source="dsr" target="ctrl"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1130" y="729"/><mxPoint x="1130" y="660"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e18" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#1155AA;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ctrl" target="arm"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e19" value="DO1/DO2 · DI1/DI2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#1155AA;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ctrl" target="rg2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1450" y="685"/><mxPoint x="1450" y="782"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e20" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=open;strokeColor=#888888;" edge="1" parent="1" source="hmi" target="web"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;PreWash-Cell 시스템 아키텍처 (PC 단위) — 노드 □ · 토픽 ◯ · 패키지(함수) ┄ · 화살표 라벨 = 서비스/메시지 타입/함수&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;9/18 구조 변경(DSN-02b): 노드 2개 · f1·f2·f3는 flow_node가 부르는 파이썬 함수 · 로봇 명령은 메인 스레드 하나" style="text;html=1;fontSize=14;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1500" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="note" value="개발 중에는 mock 모듈(f2_sense_flow.mock — 같은 함수 이름, 민범진)이 f1·f3 함수를, fake_state_pub(황인재)이 /flow/state · /flow/event 를 대신한다 → 로봇·남의 코드 없이 개발.   각자 단독 시험은 rig_f*.py.   PC-A ↔ PC-B 는 같은 스위치의 DDS." style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#555555;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="980" width="1600" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>